    "growth_divergence_warning": "Equity 5yr CAGR 17.9% vs reported EPS 3yr CAGR 1.6% and 5yr 12.1%: equity growth is inflated by the ~C$5bn all-share CWB acquisition (FY2025) and reported FY2025 EPS is depressed by CWB integration charges and initial PCL on acquired loans. Neither is a clean organic growth rate.",
    "notes": "Periods: FY2020-FY2025 (5yr) and FY2022-FY2025 (3yr), October year-end. FCF CAGRs not meaningful for a bank (OCF dominated by deposit and trading-book flows). Adjusted diluted EPS FY2024 10.39 -> FY2025 11.28 (+8.6%) -> TTM 12.70."
