    "share_count_basis": "383.581M common shares at 2026-07-31 (Q3 FY2026 press release) grossed up 1.2% for dilution (Q3 basic/diluted EPS 3.29/3.25) = 388.3M fully diluted. Held FLAT: NCIB buybacks (391.1M -> 383.6M over 9 months) are a use of the FCFE being valued, so shrinking the count as well would double-count them.",
    "wacc_rationale": "Cost of equity 9.75% in CAD: 10y GoC ~3.3% + beta ~1.1 x ERP ~5.5% + ~0.4% for Quebec concentration and Capital Markets trading share of revenue. Same level as BMO/TD (9.75%), between RY (9.5%) and BNS (10.0%). Held at 9.75% in all three scenarios so risk is charged once, in the flows.",
